  <h2 class="section-title">24V System · Dual 2,500W Alternators · LiFePO4 48V Cold Start · Self-Sustaining</h2>
  <p class="section-lead">
    Electrical system carried forward from Phase 20. 24V primary system. Two alternators at 2,500W each driven by the 17.5:1 chain off cylinder shaft 1 give 5,000W total at operating RPM.
    Boiler maintenance ~1,000W. Vehicle accessories ~500W. Net surplus ~3,500W continuously charging LiFePO4. Cold start: 48V/100Ah fires flash boiler heater. Self-sustains by 200 RPM.
    CVT hydrostatic transmission is hydraulic — draws minimal electrical power versus the 4-speed PCW valve electrical overhead in Phase 20.
